1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
[Neferpitou] Oh, yeah, it's so simple.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
All I need to do is fix him.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
That's what I'm gonna make my ability.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
The only question is
how we'll manage to win.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
If you have any ideas,
I'd be glad to hear them.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
You love to tease, don't you?

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000
At this rate, you're never going to
defeat Knuckle and Shoot,

8
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,000
much less the Chimera Ants.

9
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,000
[Gon] No way.

10
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,000
We'll never give up.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
We will go back to the NGL.
I don't care what we have to do.

12
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

13
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,000
[singer singing in English]

14
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,000
DUEL X AND X ESCAPE

15
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:46,000
[narrator] As the Queen
prepares for labor,

16
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:50,000
she requires the equivalent
of 250 human meatballs per day

17
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,000
in order to give birth to a strong king.

18
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,000
[heart beating]

19
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,000
[gasps]

20
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,000
[heart continues beating]

21
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,000
[grunting]

22
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,000
[grunting continues]

23
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:59,000
[Palm] I have to wonder.
Will this be enough?

24
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:02,000
Can they execute the plan
to slaughter Morel's pupils?

25
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,000
[Biscuit] Okay, all done!

26
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,000
[boys groan]

27
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:21,000
You two finally held out
for three whole hours.

28
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:24,000
-[both panting]
-We did it. That was hard.

29
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,000
No kidding. I can't even move an inch.

30
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:31,000
Don't be silly. Get back up.

31
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,000
Going where?

32
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:38,000
-To see Knuckle, of course.
-[both gasp]

33
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,000
[Killua] But why?

34
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:43,000
See? You can move after all. Let's go.

35
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,000
But why are we gonna go see Knuckle?

36
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:49,000
[groans] Don't ask
when the answer is obvious.

37
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,000
To fight him!

38
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,000
[both gasp]

39
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,000
[gasps]

40
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,000
[Biscuit] Now let's go!

41
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:58,000
What the hell are you talking about?
We still have some time, don't we?

42
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:09,000
What matters now is who gets the tiles.

43
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,000
-You got it?
-[Gon] Yeah.

44
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:13,000
That means
you'll have to take theirs at any cost.

45
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:18,000
If it looks like you're going to lose,
run away, and try again the next day.

46
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:21,000
So, three hours of Ren practice a day.

47
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,000
After that, you'll challenge Knuckle

48
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:26,000
and keep at it until you win.

49
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,000
[Knuckle groans]

50
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,000
No one today either.

51
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:52,000
Hmm. Now, who's your owner?

52
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:55,000
-Oh, they're bad owners, aren't they?
-[whines]

53
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:58,000
[chuckles] Stop it. That tickles.
Hey, knock it off.

54
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:00,000
I said stop, okay? [laughs]

55
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,000
Uh… [clears throat]

56
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:31,000
-Do you think that's Knuckle?
-I do.

57
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,000
[gasps]

58
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,000
I can't believe this.
It's you two? Really?

59
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:48,000
[both grunt]

60
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,000
[gasps]

61
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,000
[growls]

62
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,000
Well, well, well.

63
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:00,000
I guess they don't have
much respect for me.

64
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,000
[both gasp]

65
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:07,000
[Knuckle] If I'm being compared
to a couple of snot-nosed little kids,

66
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,000
[growls]

67
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:17,000
[Gon] What a presence.

68
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:20,000
[Killua straining] We should act first,
but we can't move.

69
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,000
[both gasp]

70
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,000
There's no way you punks can defeat me.

71
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:01,000
I'm not upset at all.

72
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,000
These are just… They're, uh…

73
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,000
They're tears from laughing too much,
you fool.

74
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:09,000
Don't tell anyone about this,
or I'll murder you.

75
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,000
[both] Huh?

76
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:20,000
I'll show you just how much stronger I am,

77
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:25,000
and once I do, you'll see that
I don't even need to dodge your punches.

78
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,000
Hit me to your heart's content.

79
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:33,000
But if I don't budge an inch… And I won't…

80
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:36,000
You have to leave your tiles behind
and walk away.

81
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:39,000
That's the best deal you'll ever get!

82
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:43,000
You're both insane if you think
you can pick a fight with me at your age.

83
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:48,000
[Killua] Well, you're the one
who challenged us to a duel.

84
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,000
Is what I want to say.

85
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:56,000
But I can tell.
We're nowhere near Knuckle's level,

86
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:11,000
[Gon] Fact is we can't overcome everything
with willpower.

87
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:21,000
I don't have any comebacks,

88
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:24,000
but I'm not just gonna
stand here and take it.

89
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:33,000
Just so you know, I won't stop hitting you
until you move, all right?

90
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,000
Less talk, more action.

91
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,000
Do what you gotta do.

92
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:43,000
[Gon grunts] Show me rock!

93
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,000
[gasps]

94
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,000
[Knuckle] Whoa, whoa, whoa.

95
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:58,000
I'll use Gyo.
Wait! I have to defend with Ko.

96
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,000
Crap!

97
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,000
But where do I defend?

98
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:10,000
Think.

99
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:14,000
I'd expect him to attack the belly.

100
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:18,000
That's his only real choice.
That must be it, the belly.

101
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:20,000
[Gon] Jan…

102
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:22,000
[Knuckle] Yes, it's the belly!

103
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:24,000
Belly, belly, belly!

104
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,000
[Gon] …ken…

105
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:34,000
-[rumbling]
-[glass cracking]

106
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,000
[body thudding]

107
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,000
[dog whimpers]

108
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,000
[gasps]

109
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,000
Uh…

110
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,000
And you didn't…

111
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:09,000
let me down. Thanks.

112
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,000
[groans]

113
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:20,000
What's with this guy? Is he crazy?

114
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,000
[groans]

115
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:42,000
Hey! Look who's awake.

116
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,000
[groans]

117
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,000
You're stronger than I realized.

118
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:50,000
I'll give you credit.
Guess I really should have before.

119
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,000
[Killua chuckles softly]

120
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:58,000
ROOK

121
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:00,000
[Knuckle] Why didn't you take this?

122
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:12,000
That tile, it isn't what we were after.

123
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:16,000
All we wanted was to be able to beat you
in a battle fair and square.

124
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,000
Can I ask you something?

125
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:24,000
Uh, sure. So what is it you wanna know?

126
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,000
Why did you wanna become a Beast Hunter?

127
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:29,000
[Knuckle] Hmm? [sighs]

128
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:31,000
It's a pretty long story,

129
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:34,000
one that brings back
a whole bunch of bad memories.

130
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:39,000
In that case, why did you volunteer
for the Extermination Team?

131
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:50,000
My master says I'm naive,
but I don't care.

132
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:52,000
If you've never seen something,

133
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:55,000
then you don't have the right
to pass judgment on it.

134
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:03,000
[Killua] Only problem is
you'll get yourself killed that way.

135
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,000
[Gon chuckles softly]

136
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:09,000
You're a real good kid.

137
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:11,000
I knew the moment
we started duking it out.

138
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:15,000
-You, too, Mr. Knuckle.
-Eh?

139
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,000
[Gon grunts]

140
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,000
Uh…

141
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,000
[whining]

142
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:22,000
[Knuckle] It's you!

143
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:25,000
[Gon] Yeah.
We couldn't get him to leave your side.

144
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,000
-[whimpering, barking]
-I've heard it said

145
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:31,000
that good Hunters
are well liked by animals.

146
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,000
[whimpering]

147
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,000
I'm so close to Morel's pupil.

148
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,000
[chomping]

149
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,000
Wow, this is delicious!

150
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,000
[gasps]

151
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:28,000
Fight me whenever you want.

152
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,000
[boys] Huh?

153
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:31,000
[Knuckle] You can take
all the tries you need.

154
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:37,000
But we only have 20 days left now,
so it's not like you can beat me.

155
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:41,000
[both chuckle softly]

156
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,000
[Knuckle sighs] So good.

157
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:05,000
What's all this smoke?
Where is it coming from?

158
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,000
[yells]

159
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,000
[gasping]

160
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:18,000
Where am I?

161
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:26,000
Let's get this started, shall we?

162
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,000
[Colt] What?

163
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:32,000
Chiona's squadron is missing?

164
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,000
That's right.

165
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:35,000
And was it the same way
that Reikei's disappeared?

166
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,000
Yes, it appears so.

167
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:42,000
The leader went missing first,
then the rest of them vanished one by one.

168
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,000
Hmm.

169
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,000
and the food is scattering farther away.

170
00:15:56,000 --> 00:16:02,000
If humans target us in a long hunt,
it could mean trouble for us, and a lot.

171
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:18,000
[sighs] Though that idea
doesn't thrill me at all.

172
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,000
[machinery humming]

173
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,000
[liquid bubbling]

174
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:37,000
Mmm. Needs to be
more concentrated, I think.

175
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:41,000
[Peggy] Just as expected.

176
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:46,000
Well, this is better
than getting erratic orders, I suppose.

177
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:49,000
We should begin by determining
our current troop strength.

178
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,000
How many squadron leaders?

179
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:56,000
[Peggy] Assuming Chiona was taken out,
28 remain.

180
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:01,000
[Colt] Each squadron leader
has four officers

181
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:03,000
and, in some cases, five,

182
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:21,000
And the four squadrons that are missing
fall under the latter category?

183
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:30,000
I highly doubt
that they would listen to advice.

184
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,000
[Netero] If you ask me,

185
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:47,000
I'd say that's the strategy
they've come up with by now.

186
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:51,000
Well, we should be able
to keep the current plan then.

187
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:01,000
Actually, I think it might be good

188
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:03,000
to tangle with a trap
every once in a while.

189
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:30,000
If all goes well, we'll eliminate
another three or four squads

190
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:43,000
we'll finish up
before reinforcements arrive.

191
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,000
I hope…

192
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:48,000
[wind blowing]

193
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:50,000
…things go that way.

194
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:00,000
[both panting]

195
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,000
[Knuckle] Here.

196
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:17,000
-[dogs whining]
-Huh?

197
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:19,000
There are more of you guys
than I realized.

198
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:22,000
-Well, don't hold back. Go on and eat too.
-[dog barks]

199
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:23,000
[Knuckle chuckles]

200
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,000
[chuckles]

201
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,000
[grunts]

202
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:38,000
They came back.

203
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:03,000
I can take on both of you at once.

204
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:07,000
You think you're better than us,
but I don't give a damn.

205
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:09,000
We're still more than happy to accept.

206
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,000
[grunting]

207
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,000
[Gon grunts]

208
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,000
[screams]

209
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,000
Give me a break.

210
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:44,000
I could keep playing with you kids,
but I just don't have that kind of time.

211
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:51,000
[yelling]

212
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:56,000
Now that's more like it. Ha!

213
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:01,000
Their bodies are worn out.

214
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:05,000
All that's moving them now
is sheer willpower.

215
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:09,000
Once they've accomplished
the task at hand,

216
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:13,000
their renewed confidence
will allow them to improve exponentially.

217
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:25,000
That ain't gonna happen!

218
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:12,000
[closing theme music playing]

219
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:23,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

220
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:36,000
[Gon] Next time,
Rock-Paper-Scissors and Weakness.

221
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:38,000
Killua! Tickle, tickle, tickle!

222
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:41,000
[Killua laughs] Stop. It's my turn.

223
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:47,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
